CHIRP-Web
=========

This project is a browser-native frontend for CHIRP, a free open-source
radio programming tool created by Dan Smith (KK7DS) and the CHIRP
community.

Upstream project: https://github.com/kk7ds/chirp
Project website:  https://chirpmyradio.com/

The contents of vendor/chirp/ are imported as a git submodule from the
upstream CHIRP repository and are governed by the GNU General Public
License version 3 (or later). See vendor/chirp/COPYING for the full
license text.

The CHIRP-Web wrapper code (everything outside vendor/) is also licensed
under GPL-3.0-or-later to remain compatible with the upstream project.

